1
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:10.822
Catrat y’esinga okuvaako obuzibe bw’amaaso obujjanjabwa mu nsi yonna.

2
00:00:10.822 --> 00:00:18.917
Kikulu okusobola okwekebejja omulwadde n’okukakasa ekivaako catrat ejjanjabibwa.

3
00:00:18.917 --> 00:00:24.155
Tandika ng’obuuza oba cyclose ebadde ya mpolampola oba ya mangu.

4
00:00:24.155 --> 00:00:31.774
Singa eriiso erimu oba gombi likosebwa, era singa wabaddewo obulumi oba okwetegekera kwonna.

5
00:00:31.774 --> 00:00:36.060
Ekiddako, gezaako obukali bw’okulaba ku bbanga ne mu A.

6
00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:41.060
Kozesa ekituli kya ppini okukakasa nti obutaba na ndabirwamu si kye kivaako.

7
00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:43.060
Olwo laba obutuli obuddugavu obw’amaaso.

8
00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:47.060
Baddugavu, beetooloovu era benkanankana?

9
00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.060
Bakola ku kitangaala?

10
00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:54.060
Bw’oba olina ettaala eyaka, kebera oba akatuli akaddugavu ak’eriiso eziyiza.

11
00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:59.060
Mu cataract ey’omulembe, akatuli akaddugavu ak’eriiso esobola okulabika ng’enjeru.

12
00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:04.060
Ne mu cataract, akatuli akaddugavu ak’eriiso ekyalina okukola ku kitangaala.

13
00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:11.060
Kebera nnyo emmanju w’eriiso n’ekintu ekiyitibwa acolyte oba n’ekyuma ekimu.

14
00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:17.060
Kebera okukakasa nti tewali kikyamu kirala ku liiso naddala enkovu y’amaaso.

15
00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:24.060
Nga olina acolyte, osobola n’okukebera oba olina yellow oba reindefundal reflex.

16
00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:28.060
Mu liiso eririna ekizibu ky’amaaso, wayinza okubaawo ebifo ebiddugavu.

17
00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:32.380
Patch ezibula oba nga teziriiwo ddala, nga zitunudde

18
00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:36.700
enzirugavu oba wadde enjeru mu bitundu by’amaaso ebikuze.

19
00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:41.872
Singa okulaba kuba kubi ate nga fanroly flex erabika bulungi, olwo wayinza okubaawo

20
00:01:41.872 --> 00:01:42.980
be nsonga endala

21
00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:45.020
olw’okufiirwa okulaba.

22
00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:50.500
Kino kibaawo naddala singa akatuli akaddugavu ak’eriiso tezinyiga bulungi ku kitangaala.

23
00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:56.100
Okukebera emabega w’eriiso kijja kuyamba okuzuukusa ekikyamu.

24
00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:02.220
Wayinza okubaawo obuzibu ku busimu bw’amaaso oba retina oba byombi.

25
00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:08.144
Obusimu buyinza okuba n’ekituli ekinene olw’obulwadde bwa glaucoma oba okugatta okuva

26
00:02:08.144 --> 00:02:10.260
okufiirwa omusaayi, okunyigirizibwa

27
00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:12.620
oba obutaba na mmere.

28
00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:20.900
Retina eyinza okwonooneka olw’obulwadde bwa sukaali, enkovu olw’obuwuka oba eyinza okwekutula.

29
00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:25.820
Mu mbeera eno, okulongoosa omutima kuyinza obutalongoosa kulaba.

30
00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:33.100
Mu bufunze, bw’oba weetegereza obulwadde bw’amaaso, kwata ebyafaayo, kebera visiography, tunuulira...

31
00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:38.460
mu maaso g’eriiso okukakasa okuzimba amaaso n’okuggyako endwadde endala.

32
00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:45.660
Tunuulira olabe oba bipus yeetooloovu, ddugavu, symmetrical era ekola ku kitangaala, era oba

33
00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:51.340
asobola okukola okukebera okuddamu okufulumya amazzi mu ngeri ya fondle n’okukebera emabega w’eriiso.
